target/
# Internal docs stay untracked; the contributor source guide is tracked.
docs/*
!docs/source-guide.md
/docker/
.compose-data/
.idea
.env
**/.env
!.env.example
/docker/*
/portal*
aruna/compute-state/
__pycache__/
